Luyizheng Shuai  is a master student in materials science at Zhejiang Sci-Tech University with a focus on conductive hydrogel fiber.
Junmin Wan  received his Ph.D. in 2011 from the Zhejiang SciTech University. Since 2017, he is a full vice professor in Zhejiang Sci-Tech University. His main research topics are devoted to (i) structural design and preparation of novel functional fibers; (ii) structural design and performance studies of wearable fiber energy devices.
Wenfeng Ding  obtained her master’s degree in 2020 in Zhejiang Sci-Tech University, China. Her research mainly focuses on wearable sensing flexible fiber.
